        <!-- Right Panel: DNA Bars & Historical Twin Cards -->
        <mxCell id="p5" value="&lt;b&gt;⑤ Environmental DNA &amp;amp; Top-k Fire Twins&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;(Addresses Dorodnykh 2022 &amp;amp; Kübler et al. 2020)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Normalized Driver Profile (Query vs. Twins):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;ERC: [■■■■■■■■■] vs [■■■■■■■■■]&lt;br&gt;VPD: [■■■■■■■■] vs [■■■■■■■■]&lt;br&gt;Wind: [■■■■■■■] vs [■■■■■■■]&lt;br&gt;Slope: [■■■■■■] vs [■■■■■■]&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;Twin #1: Calwood Fire (CO, Oct 2020)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background:#DCFCE7;color:#166534;padding:1px 4px;&quot;&gt;95.4% Match&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;background:#991B1B;color:#FFF;padding:1px 4px;&quot;&gt;10,113 ac&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;ERC 86 (+2) | Wind 24 mph | Slope 15° | R2 Conifer&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;Twin #2: Cold Springs Fire (CO, Jul 2016)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background:#DCFCE7;color:#166534;padding:1px 4px;&quot;&gt;92.8% Match&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;background:#EA580C;color:#FFF;padding:1px 4px;&quot;&gt;528 ac&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;ERC 82 (-2) | Wind 20 mph | Slope 13° | R2 Conifer&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;Twin #3: Brian Head Fire (UT, Jun 2017)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background:#DCFCE7;color:#166534;padding:1px 4px;&quot;&gt;90.1% Match&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;background:#991B1B;color:#FFF;padding:1px 4px;&quot;&gt;71,673 ac&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;ERC 88 (+4) | Wind 23 mph | Slope 14° | R2/R1&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#94A3B8;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;fontSize=11.5;" vertex="1" parent="1">
